{"id":"srazhenie","lemma":"сражение","pos":"noun","rank":4056,"glosses":["battle, engagement (general action, fight, or encounter; a combat)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6d/Ru-%D1%81%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"сражения","plural":"сражения"},"examples":[{"text":"Это место, где произошло сражение.","en":"This is the place where the battle took place.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"place, spot"},{"g":"where"},{"g":"to take place","l":"произойти"},null]},{"text":"Том был убит во время сражения.","en":"Tom was killed in the battle.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"during"]]},{"text":"Они проиграли сражение.","en":"They lost the battle.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"to lose","l":"проиграть"},null]},{"text":"Сражение закончилось через восемнадцать минут.","en":"Eighteen minutes later, the battle was over.","words":[null,{"g":"to finish","l":"закончиться"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"eighteen"},null]},{"text":"Сражение становилось более кровавым.","en":"The fighting grew bloodier.","words":[null,{"g":"to stand","l":"становиться"},{"g":"more"},null]}]}